== 3. THE TABLE: act -> actuation status ==
  ACT                    STATUS        PRODUCIBLE AT                     JUSTIFICATION
  SHIP                   BEHAVIOURAL   fluidfix/cli.py:474, fluidfix/gu  loop.py:221 `if ruling == "SHIP"` gates _write(path,content) at loop.py:223 -- the only place a repair is committed
  ADD_STATE              WORDING       fluidfix/cli.py:474, fluidfix/lo  never compared. loop.py:230 `if set_amb or len(sites)>1` is the CODE re-testing the same facts it fed the law; the ruling only fills the message at loop.py:237
  ADD_MATERIAL           WORDING       fluidfix/cli.py:474, fluidfix/gu  guard.py:491 comparison gates ONLY `hint = ...` (guard.py:492-496). No material is ever added
  RESHAPE                NONE          -- no call site can return it --  appears only in engine.py:38's ACTS list
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY     WORDING       fluidfix/loop.py:391              loop.py:391 computes it; loop.py:392 `ok = False` is UNCONDITIONAL; the ruling only fills `why` at loop.py:396. loop.py:307's SpanEdit comment claims the act but consults no ruling
  RAISE_BUDGET           BEHAVIOURAL   fluidfix/cli.py:474, fluidfix/gu  guard.py:539 `if escalate and decide(...)=="RAISE_BUDGET"` gates the whole depth-first escalation pass (guard.py:540-616). loop.py:242 is wording only
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE WORDING       fluidfix/cli.py:474, fluidfix/gu  guard.py:612 and 618 gate ONLY `hint`. The harvest itself (loop.py:407-410 tried_log) is unconditional and never consults a ruling
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR       NONE          -- no call site can return it --  appears only in engine.py:39's ACTS list

